{
 "id": "transitions/paper-fold",
 "name": "Paper Fold",
 "name_id": "Lipat Kertas",
 "category": "transitions",
 "description": {
  "id": "Adegan lama menjadi selembar kertas yang dilipat dua kali seperti origami, rebah, lalu hilang; adegan baru datang sebagai lipatan yang berdiri dan membuka. Sisi belakang kertas kraft berserat, bayangan lembut di bawah lipatan. Membungkus modul paperFoldTransition (versi DOM).",
  "en": "The old scene becomes a sheet folded twice like origami, lies down and vanishes; the new scene arrives as a packet that stands up and unfolds. Fibrous kraft back, soft shadow under the fold. Wraps the paperFoldTransition module (DOM variant)."
 },
 "tags": [
  "transisi",
